(21623: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: parity%2Fgrammars%2Fnative%2Fproto.lino%20is%20a%20canonical%20native%20Links%20Notation%20grammar%20that%20js%2Fscripts%2Fimport-native-grammars.mjs%20imports%20from%20the%20pinned%20src%2Fgrammar.json%20of%20tree-sitter-proto%200.6.0%2C%20with%20every%20rule%20renamed%20to%20its%20English%20name%20and%20its%20concept%20merged%20into%20the%20shared%20concepts%2C%20and%20every%20hand%20decision%20recorded%20in%20parity%2Fgrammars%2Fmerge-reports%2Fproto.json.%20Both%20executors%20build%2C%20for%20every%20source%20of%20the%20upstream%20test%2Fcorpus%20and%20for%20hand-written%20sources%2C%20exactly%20the%20concrete%20syntax%20tree%20rows%20of%20the%20tree-sitter-proto%20oracle%20with%20no%20ambiguity%3A%20syntax%20and%20edition%20statements%2C%20package%2C%20import%2C%20weak%20and%20public%20imports%2C%20options%20with%20plain%2C%20parenthesized%20and%20extension%20names%20and%20text-format%20message%20values%2C%20messages%20with%20nested%20messages%20and%20enumerations%2C%20singular%2C%20optional%2C%20required%20and%20repeated%20fields%20with%20field%20options%2C%20proto2%20groups%2C%20oneofs%2C%20map%20fields%2C%20reserved%20ranges%20and%20names%2C%20extension%20ranges%2C%20extend%20blocks%2C%20enumerations%20with%20negative%20and%20aliased%20values%2C%20services%20with%20unary%20and%20streaming%20remote%20procedure%20calls%2C%20decimal%2C%20octal%2C%20hexadecimal%20and%20floating-point%20literals%2C%20inf%20and%20nan%2C%20booleans%20and%20adjacent%20strings%20with%20escape%20sequences%3B%20comments%20are%20extras.%20Both%20executors%20reject%20invalid%20input%20the%20oracle%20recovers%20from%20and%20keep%20every%20source%20byte%2C%20line%20breaks%20included%2C%20in%20the%20tree.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
